  "title": "Video Watermarking and Motion Preservation",
  "summary": "arXiv Computer Vision reports on Video Geometry Corrector (VGC) and PoseRegen, both addressing the challenges of geometric and motion consistency in video generation. These methods improve robustness against watermark removal attacks while preserving original motion structures.",
